{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/58f579fc6fe987bf05e9db04e3af39d253d4e65729311a42d667988c7f26aa1b7815da45cb1a8546e15071193173507e8bd5a5ec45987a2b28dbb175cb0ffbc3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b9a8bc6fb9037065c8c5da5dab2dd66e89b6a0e78f3e40d571d612a07ccfb76755d0f5316004d65629311f3ac79eecb831a378248db16fade9c18d339f0cc16dc066fef9d2b6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/84c2c9d8e05d5cf918418c712a86ce05fce7b42015429260989442efcc95bf93d7927c80741266d461f5b22d7bacb70bb6f0e689909a0ebb1572b138af42c4ee64f1e6fb42cd575d9b642791abe429c20eda8949681e02abadf357a529f35971aa001f62e9362fc98bd754f7691c2be9fb93aa836d77fe7f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e86199e1a6b740c50c7173b553f7ed992d2cacf0ef5dc0c1cd977bf5abcb3c38b374c0751e7537024bad2b70f0357b7731662042aef6086b7cc73783e3be38b033586af55a3e833eb009800c24eb1527f40799c729e5e7130611f488af6243ad597e16f09788ddf5d98f1ebb8379e26d665281855d032095\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cb32a7bf87ad56a37812917301e26f77c3b7bd970c2138732a8dda7f38584e91e9640253e485b17676a1e1b41e71c4c7d0da5a5f04ac634c8693c46c42d491862d651d89d9868279f53f8e04a8466cdf326161387196dd08fd667364930796633e42a45767c78867e501b06e265fe014ae59fdacb71c2ac1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/99f02ec5c9d510194bc4c4c18c37fa777ae32354c910c9c3cba776388f2c4003eab6047b34885e8fc16d0ba2b170c03e1725bec26f29ee90a7f38e47e77733a63181a1027379e3bfde13d531e1baf9d5ffba58ae49b468535152741a7dd03b244bd3e139d235dbabdd6c268be5131a268475e161e29a4fad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/16b4eec48bedf70267061f822df4d1eae6fa75337afc435884ef49e8d9b25e3ded7caa0fa69f92d4f28791e91c7919478c101cf16934191a3450e91a9e0f3edf26ab86bcf9ed4936deb8f8f3c3230fb20783d3ce97a633263ba0d2cc3825c29d2977f97f30e53811636d31eea0236f8c54873a6a99168a8e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3352d2a79117b5ae82b63c79e32b9cb081b57def282fdac0a5b631ef80c1a4ef41bf357cc60149fe379cbea150c89cb1b2bbf7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/87a993d85585d747d7367ec47f43c0c680907d58be0b8698338d59b77ecd618dbe3a1458668635f4206474d47e91aab0b9b10785f4d867847698bcb1ee9fd934bc5339fef8f1ac1df632bf63f3d4f7ec20c65cfa001febf6148402222bd04029293124bd55766ab725d25c9a551c79ffd4d62253f73c72ee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f2b0f02cf36637d069be75ccd89afcbc3fa502a4c25768a1724016c9ccfad271d25ade47c6cc386f6b7324a290311149e311ca09e0c9d9e95cb3835401efed1466cb38a457bd8725f53606f479adffbf126cd4ee53b00e0990b562c8ea2fc322357ad7536727cb2137338e464c569285725e8cb9819b1678\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/01de25fd6e6ebd491682c5bffc3c6a0dbd6d7054a9fc35e51824c9024b29c811a29b2611b1ad0d01f170b3b405eb863d5b8dec5b8eebafd9a424e02cc6c0544af233ea7e68186ba55d181d4217e7b56583dfa4bfac299494b5ae13b956ff6f7ad220aae11d003e754b2d2d72f562e6fd9e9f07b3a9d83b5a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/489206520cd9b87bb27528852115754c2c2c93b8be9a8284d3a4ba4043ec713833ac8d8442e9e27bddae341f90523f2b8530c2e4c6d01304855d4b1dd109681fbeebf68addc027b03956eb06b7b4eba4fe0795618270293e0523c90091b8993d073e0d32f7c819a497e77de8f8bdbe6e2280a682422f6ce0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ff661c268797163cf187567ea9e4661cadf3f355791159d26307e9fcb0cbd6f43d6c8830da8cc7b174892b1aba5cfcb6c005465fb2ce4f3eb1f0f816f11b2ec303f0464587d4234ae5ee0fa01ffff3b650df93bd9314ff61a68667d4e64d667a364b30a19dc707b68897236456e454ecf7cbfcd7fb64a8eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/db5c2b1fb1e865c79c0917cf930bdda8e2e135ddd92e1e268fd1a380f060b46d0a1a846eddfd415dd2b75feaeda6c552dfb6eaf6e8e06f686045f0805e80ba2235175661953adb02cbb24bc18916c55448c48b44a35e64b28a48b659bfe417b7f230202d7996920901a7e019dff505f1362e16cdca8e488d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2fa5c55be1647b04b9d66f3c264c81669e071afbec19f8caf729191964dc78d64d14b40637b7e9a71aa5fc83c498abc1de1922c937866afbcc1bf6b435f3bc9735e9e29dcd9b7290693448fc0c2e44435a5c44e6c2114fd5c5f08a7e75c914968a9bdac0ee147ea506075d88851fac7cabce61ad4d649f15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2070408b243626d01bfbf853868e80606c79315825d6e173cf028c02a7fc07996dffb13209050df8470f2fcaed54d629f77a532777fb17f951e3108261752ccde6d2cced89f299cf17687b35eca1d835bb9fd8fa9eaa3f6e20efdc3c6ad3add3ed3527a107babd3fdbbbfca9763d8dfb181e1d97c91ee127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7231bdc9984ed8af0ce4b3b53db2b2242adbd8e7e549bf4474d373484189c04a867882b1e0485e56c52f8333047164a1f9554ac61680adc432390ca9d3326a63347572e7c3077a0ce3b4e3d02c4289c7294851c8a1cc9e288432738d32fbffd2f0d4b81762145857cb7ba914d1261ae9edbb77d5427d0438\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a4204ad10ae309d793cc53da54a82b387db9684f4e9a91ecb818415789c78f4e5808ba9fc2597cfa1e9900968bc0abb7f112227c918f9e44087976f1b52274850d728bb6a051912a0731cf770cabf09f0d9a5b6dc8dc5e48384dc938fd2bfa78dd001dd6fe7ee9edc8984fe21a19d8ca93f4cbc5319250dc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ada48d4fbe9a69a07d82fc5aec6cfcd33d5ed842ed22b3db7341311ec1a0fdd10c2bd71922049f50edcfb213b73af9ba0b03a93cb302b8585d767d33bc9e3c1f9be1032080b414998ebe6c31dd47023bdd7e16a0b91ea884fbc43796cb4a20ee3a7799801f0e08e8845f588f8fb59a6def0768143ef028e3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/118b2a329c4af1c40b077a4f82b54118c7ddd5392753f092f06ac5593f7bb03731daaefddba518ef498ac7491fb1e55e3398df55fb76c838217004fb199b556befb41a07eadf0c5022e44c3d5d2ae0a7efce924a86e4bbcdd4d52c5668263bad5ca3893155c33c57b9c999a72e4cdb99d2478bfa4ec15913\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/648b8a5ef0e55d1ca6bdad21150460443e9d96be58b0f28473730a48273cb753f9fabe691b6c7111140ed48047944e97dff1a853b593edcadad26e733872cc08f13cfda1d86acd3bb2ca9219c80548cadb97025de1276c5436952a3037312b9c985eb17dcfe0a7220db5b08e7a50651afc3cc0ef2067afbc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2f63012635fd43cdf5772b9d8accbc38222ced6f376f1285c32ff68c7fcab991bb9acc94da4410d7fae9aa0737919ecd92b44c9952f9ce2a99894f74ef0d4986e261ab3e455c62be9b7cafca26beed6935df03fb8da919369f0742ca21fd270a1a31cce91720a7df08a1ebfe047fa7bfc65903c85849d732\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/13f656e078ad568394ec293d3cfcc07a2a1fec26ca8cd945aec98f0d1722a4237ca418f9459f37beeecd655203483b5e6608fcc0949e5b4fa0a2e6e78f807a0b2cc8eb57af715136e07c88e1dcb7ed0ca0c4abe519638036daed17afd462092cf9c54b2340a529f75fb8415dd83eeafa213410c2e2b032f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e3b731fda567c0ad1af7e226ca2d0fd6422398b027fcca960dab1eb5261721e517e17a3f8564db4f3f1e304147ab585c504f60447bd77ff7c66e5e9cb9f96b0cc85520d440f96d78755191f6026259563ff66985cf129842381d0b6d616c1014a48c2818c0da08bd138c972ad780fecf7a1fb75b090c92df\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f4cc811bb2159ed7dd1b6cb3b70bec3016667cac82281b2c62126555301b5bc1e935bf4ccc02c48ec382acdfc9abd9309a08c725ae4c144f3d809568742f32fb3968e5196749ccbe4b85eef4046dc9880b97c1b4c8db1c3df5f5a6afe796b5fe66f5adc54accd7c6299bf8ad1d765c2eb277f098dac91772\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5d64de5651c916d3b21b8c0ffad729a4cd423afc7f1194144f0694c1bfa5eab1d7bef14610705bf6c04a902a91dc74cb36a924d520a12c4e367c4812626b446830b8cb3da0e9f6a589058a00e3aaeea05d9d64a71b28cc95213788056b667807692ccb6cff493bfc341b2af447cdf79f888c372f7abcf884\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/eac1a3b0f1a97a3415b8ba4ddfb5eea9e737b621ae1d9c0d8e9333031c90be1d404c6c0139e6eb977f57d39f3e5e39785b913d78538884ff792c5f6ca767a2c2bd44957951a0305ad4081942ab1b1bd8ec34fbdc2a361ba262baf4bbfe3a3e24bfd370d1a46cfdf45036eb992d8201bf80332b15783ec581\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2ccec04f71ffbfe81830a5489daf2a800111a7006e841a6af051f3c79836217504cec5074abda8d2067c46d8c13d79e2ab060aa4772b2c4ca4db1a7c69fbcfa47e2048065bfb24097278c38d8253e986594c04a3982b316110db0a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a5df046ea12b4c4ba6ea5353d0e53e1a7c27bf9e35fa130be060a4322ce4126183277362f3384ed3fcac52df2a0c3d59c7813706b3f2a630e619e83eb52af83c84cbbc15c08bb4db05d45296cbb988c0e3d054d829bc522485651d998882b87401721f2bb7b156edf602cb4ad874d5cd21df243a1cf40c07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/35fc61f9f5e76c35b23a215369c91a30ba3a7126f54458778e566f01356801dbfcc3c6ab8303704c62385f0e98d0c6506941b7e1ed6bf12525390e0b8bda695627d1122f960242903db664ae7602fddd2f4971c92ef2083a094af954dc62a6fdb191e61af5173f1fdfdd20d9f807dff4b791fc60452b1a34\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/00e5f6a7db876d5868a34deb16c77c6fa508f135019e81f145e606440bf48abb98d7ff76cdc0d6c0e65ad25ca81f340202f2879e30fb4262356c10974d974a5e644c8453e9d310e68a36d7ffe0d1a0e1711a76f6311ae4a37ff0fc7de4324c2768f578549f60b10be7fb51d0e985788772487c2b0f03d098\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7106f53aa9a78afad98353bc9cd1eb57fee632119124aea6f021cb4a529430934d95f6e9432dd6da30e20df55f30dd1c1689a24be7fa5d81507af269b4b6e78fc4b518bf44d77bda20b930baacf88569095328c25a337d8462e4b1944177dbe861eb7e8d8da89732f85d93583b9acbfa45027a585d343b6c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ef0005373a09312fda615215bf0ebadc3321e9bd7f5964a3a905e8dcb1779c899e01b87328050f60cd13000903132c75a09c3c0f65eb4f3acf38f3b1516b86d38e3e6d22308b00fc3fd515608c52b8933222b8cbfc984182f10e70e94b552f52913d73bb837e433f2cb32db5878cb841eb4848f18d7f8a12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/61e52fb9847a380d12f39824d9e17ab5519e449ea8fbb57de5fb64a3aadf84db89909583829886a5c8a51761da0d4b1724c5df9ca0b919577c4c018419a15c3f7838797766e56e059663510622daa730ae954c1792efdc365a300d8640a69fd8c74a50612f537eaacb90f88e6e6699bad2a97d6249bfe1b9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/93df8e82961fb6780a1efe07035a0b6f91cd773a45d1d86936e483874270f20f2fafafb79344e06be0a2255628ab46b73daee5729421d42f8502605cc598cb0123ec0ff5082d711c672da0efd148fd90af1256c96e373f2a4600207686896feec67c404a7b3e0f27c01d82bfefb17e8376a42070bffc03b9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
